   const realBase = path.resolve('/var/songs');
   const realPath = path.resolve(path.join(realBase, safeFilename));
   if (!realPath.startsWith(realBase)) {
     throw new Error('Invalid file path');
   }
   ```
3. **Input Validation**: Validate the `filename` input to ensure it only contains valid characters and matches expected patterns (e.g., `.mp3` extension). Use a regex pattern to enforce this.
   ```javascript
   const isValidFilename = /^[a-zA-Z0-9_\-]+\.mp3$/.test(safeFilename);
   if (!isValidFilename) {
     throw new Error('Invalid filename');
   }
   ```

